msgstr "3. טרנספילציה של המעגל ל-Backend {#3-transpile-the-circuit-to-the-backend}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since the backend has already been chosen, we can go ahead and transpile our virtual circuit into an ISA circuit. Here, we just set the qubit layout and translate the gates into the native gate set of ``ibm_boston``.\n"
